{"title":"What should I ask Moxie Marlinspike?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/970858769/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-Moxie-Marlinspike.html","date":1790865041000,"content":"<p>Yes I will be doing a Conversation with him, live at the Roots of Progress event next week.  <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moxie_Marlinspike\" target=\"_blank\">From Wikipedia</a>:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p><b>Moxie Marlinspike</b> is an American <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Entrepreneur\">entrepreneur</a>, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cryptographer\">cryptographer</a>, and <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Computer_security\">computer security</a> researcher.<sup></sup><sup></sup> Marlinspike is the creator of <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Signal_(messaging_app)\">Signal</a>, co-founder of the <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Signal_Technology_Foundation\">Signal Technology Foundation</a>, and served as the first CEO of <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Signal_Messenger_LLC\">Signal Messenger LLC</a>. He is also a co-author of the <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Signal_Protocol\">Signal Protocol</a> encryption used by Signal, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/WhatsApp\">WhatsApp</a>,<sup></sup> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Google_Messages\">Google Messages</a>,<sup></sup> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Facebook_Messenger\">Facebook Messenger</a><sup></sup> and <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skype\">Skype</a>.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>There is much more at the link, for instance he is also an anarchist of some kind or another.  So what should I ask him?</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/10/what-should-i-ask-moxie-marlinspike.html\">What should I ask Moxie Marlinspike?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/970858769/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/970858769/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/970858769/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/970858769/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/970858769/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/970858769/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/10/what-should-i-ask-moxie-marlinspike.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/10/what-should-i-ask-moxie-marlinspike.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"h